flowchart TB
    Check[Check Update] --> Verify[Verify Signature and Integrity]
    Verify --> Compatible[Check Compatibility]
    Compatible --> Backup[Back Up Configuration]
    Backup --> Install[Install Inactive Partition]
    Install --> Reboot[Reboot and Health Check]
    Reboot --> Promote{Healthy}
    Promote -->|yes| Active[Promote Version]
    Promote -->|no| Rollback[Restore Previous Partition]
    Rollback --> Audit[Audit Recovery]
    Active --> Audit
